      "nonstandard_elements": "Two NDEs tied to postpartum hemorrhage events; first NDE included witnessing her own funeral and burial while feeling she was not dead; second included teachings using beach/grains-of-sand metaphor; perception that a flower and even water/firmament were alive and loving; explicit discussion of \"free agency\" and \"Atonement.\"",
